LIMITS
Each phase image is generated and simulated independently.
This does not implement runtime opening/steady/closing switching in one FPGA image.
It is not FPGA Fmax, timing closure, LUT/BRAM, all-batch replay, full-correction,
or end-to-end one-microsecond deadline credit.
